WEBVTT

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.610
It really surprised me.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.300
Onii-sama...

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.000
The way your facial expression changed, and how you jumped in.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.520
I was wondering what was going on.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:13.280
Sorry.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.280
I was totally excited.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:21.450
But I knew that you were really my little sister, Yuzurina.

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:24.080
Oh, Onii-sama.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.280
How many times did I tell you before that?

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.710
Well...

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:30.710
Hey, Onii-sama.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:34.470
I just thought of something.

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:39.680
Why don't you choose me to accompany you to the party?

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:40.330
Eh?

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:50.900
If you can't bring a lover, you can at least bring a
relative along so Kanoko-sama won't be upset, right?

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.570
Ah, yeah...

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:57.730
A lover is not the only one who can accompany you to the party.

00:00:57.730 --> 00:01:00.120
It wouldn't be strange for you to bring a family member.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:01.550
Hmm...

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:04.490
Family...

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:05.460
Of course,

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:08.920
I won't call myself a member of your family in public.

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:11.940
Officially I'm your second cousin,

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:15.790
but even if it's only in my feelings,
I'll be your family and your little sister.

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:19.430
If I could make an appearance in a formal setting like that...

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:21.210
Yuzurina.

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:24.020
But...

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:27.780
You're worried about your friends, right?

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:29.100
Well, yeah...

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.140
Then there's no need to worry.

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:35.100
I was brought up by Kumagorou-san's father's cousin.

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:37.280
He's well known within the group.

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:42.760
If I ask him, he should be able to prepare a written invitation for them.

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:44.040
Is that true, Yuzurina?

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:27.350
Onii-sama, are you nervous?

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:29.760
It's not like that, but...

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:33.270
If you like, I can offer to escort you.

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:36.750
Hey, don't make fun of me.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.620
Welcome, Kunitachi-san.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:50.790
I'm honoured to receive the invitation, Mikadono-senpai-

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.790
Ah! We're finally here!

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.980
Mana-chan has arrived~

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:56.220
President Tendou!

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:57.550
That's dangerous!

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.260
That's no good, Rinka-chan.

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:02.880
Since you were invited, you have to give a proper greeting.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:05.720
Shougo-kun, thank you for the invitation!

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:06.510
Eh?

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:06.970
Wa-

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.810
W-What are you doing?

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.930
Giving an affectionate hug!

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:12.390
Hug, hug!

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:15.440
How long are you going to do that?

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.310
I'm sorry!

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:23.900
So, next is Konoe-chan's turn!

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:25.160
Eh?

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.160
Eh?

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:32.850
Um... Well, then...

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:38.170
Sagara-senpai, that outfit?

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:41.420
It's a witch outfit.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:42.670
Is there something strange about it?

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.880
Um...

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:53.600
W-What?

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:54.540
Ah, nothing.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:56.310
I'm glad you wore an appropriate dress.

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.310
I was just thinking that you look cute today.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.530
Hey, let's hurry up and go to the party.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:07.380
I skipped lunch because I was looking forward to the food,

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:09.530
so I'm really hungry.

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.910
President Tendou!

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:16.290
You'd better hurry up and show them around, then.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:17.250
That's right.

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:19.490
I'll show you to the assembly hall.

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:21.250
A feast, a feast!

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:32.820
...Nevertheless, the transition will be great.

00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:36.880
The source of the socio-economic problems our group faces,

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:39.520
is in reality a relentless thing that is,

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:41.880
something that we cannot shake off,

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.780
so in order to cope with the circumstances,

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.780
we have considered forming a merger.

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:49.280
There's much more to say about the subject,

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:54.550
but speeches and skirts should both be short.

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:56.710
So my speech won't go on for too long...

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:58.070
Good grief...

00:05:58.070 --> 00:06:00.630
Mother's speeches are as long as ever...

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.750
Well then... cheers!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.460
Cheers!

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:08.300
Mm! Delicious!

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.310
This is pretty good.

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:18.270
I might have to use this in Lyrical Sisters' new menu.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.810
Wow, this is delicious!

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:22.770
It really is!

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:26.820
It's this hotel's freshly squeezed grape juice.

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:34.030
T-That's...

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:37.000
The well-known former leader of the IT business.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.330
Mr. Nile Gale.

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:40.540
Oh! Nice to meet you.

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:44.210
So, you're Mikadono Junior?

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:45.410
Yes.

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:47.220
My name is Mikadono Shougo.

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:48.420
Oh, very good.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:50.930
Spin, spin.

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:53.180
Oh yes. Spin, spin.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:01.900
So, IT businessmen really do use a potter's wheel.

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.260
Mikadono.

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.700
Sagara-senpai.

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:10.450
Even if it is for the sake of your café, please don't steal any recipes.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.700
I can't find Kannagi.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.230
Do you know anything?

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:15.490
Miyabi?

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:17.510
It seems she's not in the assembly hall.

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:18.750
Could she be in the restroom?

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:21.000
I hope she is.

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:25.750
When Kannagi was riding in the limousine today , she looked strange.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:28.340
As if her mind were elsewhere,

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.840
like she was thinking about something.

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:33.590
Did something happen?

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:37.070
It seems Miyabi left.

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:40.100
I can't get her to answer her cell phone.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:43.200
It may be a good idea to look for her.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:54.230
But, where did Miyabi go?

00:07:54.230 --> 00:07:57.030
She couldn't have got lost, could she?

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:57.450
Huh?

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:01.090
That's... Seri-san.

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:04.290
I should ask Seri-san, and we can look togeth-

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:09.530
Shougo-kun, it's me.

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:11.140
Ikusu?

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:11.950
Shh.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:14.930
Yes.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:18.790
It was inside the luggage in the cloakroom.

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:20.540
Yes.

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:24.900
This should be enough materials about Kumagorou-sama's scandal.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:29.480
Unfortunately, I didn't find anything about the illegitimate child.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.610
The envelope and stationery were custom-made,

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:33.650
but the handwriting is probably the real thing.

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:35.700
If all goes according to plan...

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:39.160
...Shougo-sama will lose his prospect of becoming company president.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:41.950
I'll lose my prospect of becoming company president?

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.290
Yes, I'll leave that to you.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.040
Well then, I'll see you later.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:51.080
Ikusu, what's going on?

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:52.920
Calm down, Shougo-kun.

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:56.300
It seems that secretary Seri is trying to prevent you from becoming the company president.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.800
It seems she's the pawn of a conspirator.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.050
No way...

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:01.970
Lately I've been thinking her actions have been suspicious,

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:04.570
so I've disguised myself and have been searching around,

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:07.150
but I didn't think she was involved in something like this.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:09.850
We have to hurry up and tell Mother.

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:12.190
She's being deceived by Seri-san too, right?

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:13.480
Wait a moment.

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:17.990
At this time, we don't have any reliable proof to persuade Kanoko...

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:20.240
...that secretary Seri is breaking her trust.

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:23.160
Moreover, if we talk about this right now,

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.000
Kanoko may find the identity of the illegitimate child.

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:29.780
Are you prepared to protect your little sister?

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:31.500
That's...

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:33.730
Then what should we do?!

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:37.870
Kanoko should be aware that there is a
threat within the group, at the very least.

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:40.930
That person is not somebody who can be dealt with easily.

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:43.720
Well, that's true, but...

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:46.690
For the time being, let's catch her in the act.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:50.690
Let's give everything we have to that purpose.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.440
Understood.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:54.900
I'm depending on you, Ikusu.

00:09:55.310 --> 00:09:56.220
Yeah.

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:57.030
Shougo-kun, you too.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:58.660
You should be careful.

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:07.120
Damn it...

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:10.420
Seri-san betraying Mother, and deceiving me...

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:14.540
I asked that person to arrange a DNA test for me.

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:18.490
It was to find out if she really was my little sister, but I-

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:24.540
What is it?

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:25.350
Did something happen?

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:27.600
Eh... Um...

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:28.720
Kannagi-san...

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:29.580
Eh?

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:31.730
I found Kannagi-san.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:33.090
Oh, that.

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:34.690
What do you mean, "Oh, that"?

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:37.360
You were searching for Kannagi-san, right?

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:38.550
Ah, yes.

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:40.030
Thank you for finding her.

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:43.980
It looks like Kannagi-san got lost in the hotel,

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:46.160
but we'll be returning to the assembly hall now, Onii-

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:47.560
Ah, Yuzurina.

00:10:47.560 --> 00:10:50.750
Before that, there's something I wanted to talk with you alone.

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:54.420
Could you come to the lounge on the third floor?

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.260
I'll be waiting there.

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:03.930
So then, could that letter...

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:06.580
Do you have any ideas about it?

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:07.640
Yes.

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:11.050
Along with money to help raise me,

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:13.440
Kumagorou Otou-sama sent a letter.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:18.900
It could be something that shows the
connection to Kumagorou Otou-sama.

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.740
I kept that instead of a charm, but...

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:27.770
It's probably because she realised that you were my little sister.

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:30.880
She looked for some proof because of the DNA test.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:33.260
I don't know what she intends to do,

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:35.180
but it's become troublesome now.

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:37.130
Shougo Onii-sama.

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:41.840
I don't care even if I'm exposed to the world.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:42.930
Eh?

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:48.640
It's true that it may be a scandal that I'm an illegitimate child,

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.320
but in the end, it's Kumagorou Otou-sama's scandal.

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:53.850
It doesn't disgrace us.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.900
Yuzurina, you're strong.

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.030
That's...

00:11:58.030 --> 00:11:59.770
Saying I'm strong...

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:02.250
Maybe if you think that way...

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:04.250
Onii-sama, please become strong, too!

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:04.780
Eh?

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:10.110
You should stop this lewd lifestyle, and get a lover.

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:14.120
Then you can prove you can become
someone who can come to love one woman.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:17.170
Someone who can come to love one woman...

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:17.880
That's right.

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:21.170
Then if you get married and create a splendid family,

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:26.140
everybody will definitely recognise that
you are suitable to be the company president.

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:28.150
I see.

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:29.510
That's right.

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:34.710
In the first place, that's the reason I transferred to Miryuuin Academy.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:37.730
I understand, Yuzurina.

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:40.150
I'll get a lover, with serious feelings,

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:45.320
and prove to the world that I will come to be a man who loves one woman.

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:47.490
That's the way, Onii-sama!

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:51.470
Well then, should we return to the assembly hall?

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:55.750
We can't ignore the girls we invited for too long.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:57.170
That's right.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:59.250
Kannagi-san will definitely be waiting.

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:00.880
Eh, Miyabi is?

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:01.630
Yes.

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:04.120
After I found Kannagi-san,

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:09.170
I spoke with her about various things, but it was all about you.

00:13:09.170 --> 00:13:11.010
Could it be that Kannagi-san...

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:12.350
...loves you?

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:16.940
B-But, she always comes charging at me.

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:19.400
When I see Kannagi-san like that,

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:22.230
she seems like a very delicate person.

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:25.020
That's why, even though she thinks of you,

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:27.460
she can't honestly connect with you.

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:32.210
Yuzurina, what do you think about her?

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:33.700
Let's see...

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:38.340
I have the feeling I'll become good friends with Kannagi-san.

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:42.920
If Kannagi-san became Onii-sama's lover...

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:05.280
I entered the Academy to look for a lifelong companion,

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.260
but as I've been dealing with my little sister up till now,

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:09.280
I still haven't achieved my goal.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:12.830
But now I know that Yuzurina is my little sister,

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:17.210
from now on, I can look for a lover without holding back.

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.810
Shougo~

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:19.510
Eh?

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:20.670
What?

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:21.210
Miyabi!

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.120
Geez!

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:24.050
Where did you go?

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.800
That's my line, right?

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:28.240
Shougo, kiss me!

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:29.100
Kiss!

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:30.150
Kiss!

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:30.910
Kiss?

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:33.310
What are you saying in front of other people?!

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:35.680
Hey, are you... could it be...?

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:37.330
Shougo-san!

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:39.920
What on earth happened to Miyabi?

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:43.690
It seems like Kannagi-san mistook this for grape juice and drank it.

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:46.170
You'd think she'd know after she had one sip.

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:48.070
We realised and we warned her,

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:52.070
but she picked up the glass and drank it all at once.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:56.370
After she came back to the assembly hall, she was acting strangely.

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:58.790
You didn't do anything strange to her, right?

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:00.370
I didn't do anything!

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:02.660
In any case, Yuzurina was the one who found her.

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:03.900
That's right!

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:07.630
You've found me!

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:09.590
Hey, Miyabi!

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:10.630
Kannagi-san!

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:11.450
What's wrong?

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:12.550
Are you all right?

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:16.260
I feel sick...

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.290
Ah, you're awake.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:43.450
Where am I?

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:45.490
This is the hotel suite room.

00:15:45.490 --> 00:15:49.300
You were asleep, so I asked my mother to take you to the room.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.060
I see.

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:56.890
Shougo, when I was asleep, did you...

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:57.990
Idiot!

00:15:57.990 --> 00:15:59.850
As if I'd do that!

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:01.020
I see.

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:03.020
That's right...

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:07.720
Where's the shower?

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:08.860
It's over there.

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:11.970
I've been sweating a bit, so I'm going to take a shower.

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:13.840
Sure.

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:05.790
Hey, what are you-

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:09.040
Hey, Miyabi...

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.380
Miyabi, you're...

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:14.720
Shougo.

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:15.340
Yes?

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:18.180
What do you think of my breasts?

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:20.220
What do I think?!

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.800
There are things more important than appearance, right?

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:24.570
Eh?

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:26.050
Well, sure...

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:27.600
...no, that's not what I meant...

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:29.860
Hey, Shougo...

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:33.360
Just like this... with me...

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:37.480
What are you talking about?!

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:38.700
I'm being serious.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:41.870
B-But... my h-heart's not ready...

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:46.080
All right, I'll let your heart get ready.

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:08.560
Miyabi...

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.570
Are you... crying?

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:21.740
Shougo, please stay with me forever!

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:23.370
Don't go anywhere else!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.070
No!

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:27.540
I don't want you to leave me!

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:29.750
It's fine, because I'm right here.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:30.380
Liar!

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:31.250
I'm not lying.

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:32.670
You're lying.

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:35.460
After all, didn't you leave me before?

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:37.420
Even though we were supposed to play with each other all along,

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:38.800
I couldn't meet you anymore!

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:45.140
Miyabi... I'm sorry.

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:49.230
It's true that we may have been separated,

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:51.770
but didn't we meet each other by chance again?

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:55.150
From now on, I'm going to be with you, Miyabi.

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:56.480
Really?

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:58.150
Are you really going to stay with me?

00:18:58.150 --> 00:18:59.900
Yes, of course.

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:02.740
It's a promise. Really!

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:04.830
It's really a promise!

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:09.790
Miyabi...

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:29.520
Shougo-kun, thanks for the food!

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:33.520
I ate so much, and now my stomach is really full!

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:36.570
I'm also happy that you guys had a great time.

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:40.700
Thank you for inviting us to this wonderful party.

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:46.160
I'll have to have you properly introduce me to your mother.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:53.330
Um... what about Kannagi-san's condition?

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:55.460
Since it looks like she's fast asleep,

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:58.130
I thought I'd leave her alone until she wakes up.

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:00.340
When she wakes up, I'll take her back to her dorm.

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:01.880
I see.

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:03.180
Hey, Mikadono.

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:06.350
Don't you dare do anything weird to her while she's asleep.

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:08.550
I won't!

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:10.060
There's no way I would!

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:13.100
Really?

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:15.650
Fine.

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:18.270
If you do anything wrong, I'm going to curse you.

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:23.490
If you say it like that, you can be persuasive, Senpai.

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:35.630
Sagara-san was really worried about Kannagi-san.

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:38.920
The two of them get along really well, right?

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:43.590
Now that you mention it, since when have Miyabi and Sagara-senpai...

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:45.050
Shougo!

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.830
Mother!

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:47.550
What's the matter?

00:20:47.900 --> 00:20:49.620
It's not "what's the matter"!

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:51.410
What was with that mess today?

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:53.690
You didn't properly escort the lady you invited,

00:20:54.090 --> 00:20:56.980
and in the end, you let her get sick!

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:59.690
Um, that's... Miyabi's... no...

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:01.780
Kannagi-san... how should I put it...

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:03.190
She accidentally...

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:05.160
I don't want to hear any excuses!

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:07.570
In the first place, you're the irresponsible one.

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:10.660
Ever since elementary school, you'd
barely finish your summer homework.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:12.750
No, that was a long time ago...

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:14.910
Hey, say something too, Yuzurina...

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:16.170
Eh?

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:21.500
In the first place, I invited five of your
school friends, and you didn't thank me!

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:26.380
I knew you couldn't escort that number of people,

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:32.430
but because Seri said they were friends from the academy, I relented.

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:33.420
Eh?

00:21:33.420 --> 00:21:34.810
Seri-san said that?

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:38.400
Seri-san was the one who prepared the written invitations for the five people?

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:40.360
Yes, that's right.

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:42.940
She was begging for you.

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:45.820
Make sure you thank her later.

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:01.460
The pieces are all in place.

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:02.460
All that's left now is...

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:25.030
The love that ran away is searching for Eden

00:22:25.030 --> 00:22:36.620
Despite losing my bearings, I understood the weight I felt from you

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:42.250
We felt it on that summer day

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:48.340
Do you regret our meeting because of these painful lies?

00:22:48.340 --> 00:22:54.350
Are you saying it was only painful?

00:22:54.350 --> 00:23:01.980
Sweep away the coming tomorrow with those gentle hands

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:08.070
A promise forever from bygone days

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.830
We will certainly be together, because I still believe in you

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:20.830
My pounding heart won't stop now

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:26.920
It has finally begun, that lovely thing

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:38.640
To a dazzling world of bewilderment with my heavenly lover

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:43.190
Rinka-chan, today's party was fun, right?

00:23:43.190 --> 00:23:47.230
It was a shame that I lost the chance to show my dance!

00:23:47.230 --> 00:23:50.220
Rinka-chan, you were training extra hard after that dance, right?

00:23:50.220 --> 00:23:53.050
That's right, for a dance that exceeds the Dolphin Tango!

00:23:53.050 --> 00:23:58.450
The powerful dance that spreads the clouds and rends the
heavens with the dragon's crest by the name of Dragon Waltz!

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:00.610
Next time, I'll be sure to show it to you.

00:24:00.610 --> 00:24:03.880
So next time, it's episode 11: "The Little Sister's Trap".

00:24:03.880 --> 00:24:05.950
Dragon Waltz... Clouds and Dragon...

00:24:05.950 --> 00:24:07.340
In other words... Sumo!

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:08.720
Dosukoi!
